;CAF-24/0001;Support to Local Elections;CAF-0004;Elections in CAR;A;2025;10.11.2025;Planned;5 210 324;0;;2025;2026;;;4416;Kinshasa;0159;0159.75;0159.75.111;Afrika - nasjonale tiltak;Central African Rep.;U17345;Mubabela Beya, Abel;;03;;;UNDP - UN Development Programme;UNDP - UN Development Programme;United Nations;I;Project- and programme grant;Core contributions to multilaterals;Contributions to multi-donor/single-entity funding mechanisms;15151;151;Government and civil society, general;51;Elections;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Main;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;The overall goal of this project is to contribute to a transparent, inclusive, and peaceful electoral process by supporting the institutions in charge of election management, conflict arbitration and electoral process security, enhancing inclusion and participation and reducing the risk of violence. The project provides targeted and strategic UN support to ANE and other stakeholders (such as political parties and civil society) in the electoral process to address gaps in transparency, inclusion, and responsible leadership for credible elections. Through its governance, the project will also aim to identify tensions and prevent their escalation, encourage consultation and dialogue.;;
