;MEX-24/0003;In defense of the life and dignity of the victims in Guerrero's Mountain;MEX-1008;Human Rights in Mexico;B;2025;12.06.2025;Actual;224 874;0;NOK;2024;2026;Tlachinollan Grupo de Apoyo a los Pueblos Indios de la Montaña, A.C.;Grant;4440;Mexico D.F.;0152;0152.70;0152.70.111;Menneskerettigheter;Mexico;U11974;Hammeren, Line;;03;;04.11.2024;Tlachinollan Grupo de Apoyo a los Pueblos Indios de la Montana;Tlachinollan Grupo de Apoyo a los Pueblos Indios de la Montana;NGO Local;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;15160;151;Government and civil society, general;60;Human rights;;-;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;Main;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Tlachinollan is an organization that has been working intensively for 30 years to defend the human rights of the most vulnerable and have managed to strengthen a relationship of trust with people who are victims of serious human rights violations and with indigenous communities. This closeness has allowed them to accompany groups and families of missing persons from both the Montaña region and other regions of the state of Guerrero. With this project, they will be providing support to victims of serious human rights violations in the state of Guerrero, especially to the parents of the 43 students who disappeared in Ayotzinapa in 2014, and to the families of women victims of femicide. The project is focused on accompanying victims of forced disappearance in Mexico and create networks within different organizations in Mexico that carry out work on this matter.;;
;MEX-24/0003;In defense of the life and dignity of the victims in Guerrero's Mountain;MEX-1008;Human Rights in Mexico;B;2025;28.11.2025;Planned;225 126;0;;2024;2026;;;4440;Mexico D.F.;0152;0152.70;0152.70.111;Menneskerettigheter;Mexico;U11974;Hammeren, Line;;03;;04.11.2024;Tlachinollan Grupo de Apoyo a los Pueblos Indios de la Montana;Tlachinollan Grupo de Apoyo a los Pueblos Indios de la Montana;NGO Local;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;15160;151;Government and civil society, general;60;Human rights;;-;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;Main;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Tlachinollan is an organization that has been working intensively for 30 years to defend the human rights of the most vulnerable and have managed to strengthen a relationship of trust with people who are victims of serious human rights violations and with indigenous communities. This closeness has allowed them to accompany groups and families of missing persons from both the Montaña region and other regions of the state of Guerrero. With this project, they will be providing support to victims of serious human rights violations in the state of Guerrero, especially to the parents of the 43 students who disappeared in Ayotzinapa in 2014, and to the families of women victims of femicide. The project is focused on accompanying victims of forced disappearance in Mexico and create networks within different organizations in Mexico that carry out work on this matter.;;
;MEX-24/0004;Making democratization reality in MX through improved access to abortion;MEX-1008;Human Rights in Mexico;B;2025;12.06.2025;Actual;150 000;0;NOK;2024;2026;México Igualitario Derribando Las Barreras A.C.;Grant;4440;Mexico D.F.;0152;0152.70;0152.70.111;Menneskerettigheter;Mexico;U11974;Hammeren, Line;;03;;05.11.2024;Mexico Igualitario Derribando las Berreras;Mexico Igualitario Derribando las Berreras;NGO Local;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;15170;151;Government and civil society, general;70;Women’s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions;;-;-;-;-;-;-;Main;Significant;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Mexico Igualitario is a decentralized collaborative platform that seeks to strengthen the LGBTIQ+ movement and the movement for access to abortion through different strategies and programs.This project  is focused on promoting democratization for women and the LGBTIQ+ community in Mexico through strategies that expand access to civil, sexual and reproductive rights in five states in Mexico. ;;
