;MOZ-15/0006;EDM Short-Term Investment Project: Design and Implementation Support;MOZ-3096;Support for electrification through EDM;B;2025;25.02.2025;Actual;30 000 000;0;NOK;2016;2026;EDM - STIP DESIGN AND IMPLEMENTATION;Grant;4435;Maputo/Mozambique;0159;0159.75;0159.75.111;Afrika - nasjonale tiltak;Mozambique;U14815;Vikjord, Vemund;;03;;28.10.2016;Government of MOZAMBIQUE;Electricidade de Mocambique;Governments/Ministries in developing countries;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;23110;231;Energy Policy;10;Energy policy and administrative management;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;-;-;-;-;Short Term Investment Programme supports the upgarde of transmission infrastructure in Mozambique to alleciate suppply contrants and improve secrurity and quality of electricity supply. The programme is supported together with KFW and EIB. This particular programme povides support to tender package, tender assistance and construction supervision.;;
