;NOR-25/0012;Inferno Music Conference 2025;MEX-1006;Culture and Private Sector promotion ;C;2025;20.05.2025;Actual;31 842;0;NOK;2025;2025;Inferno Metal Festival;Grant;4440;Mexico D.F.;0115;0115.70;0115.70.112;Kultur- og informasjonsformål - ute/stasjonene;Norway;U17947;Gonzalez Duncan, Viveka Alexandra;;02;;13.03.2025;Inferno Metal Festival;Inferno Metal Festival;Norwegian private sector;III;Small-scale grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;99810;998;Unallocated/unspecified;10;Sectors not specified;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;As a part of the Inferno Metal Festival, the Inferno Music Conference gathers international music industry professionals to meet the Norwegian music industry. The conference is a networking conference with an educational program. It is today the biggest dedicated music industry conference and meeting arena in the world for metal and rock. In cooperation with Music Norway the program is intended to stimulate the following: exchange of knowledge and expertise and increase export of Norwegian artists and music. The festival has requested travel support for one professional from Mexico to participate in their international delegation. ;;Satisfactory
