;NPL-23/0002;Climate Smart Education: Supporting Green School Initiative in Nepal;NPL-3042;Support to education, civil society;B;2025;14.11.2025;Planned;1 000 000;0;;2023;2026;UNESCO;;4337;Kathmandu/Nepal;0159;0159.76;0159.76.111;Asia - nasjonale tiltak;Nepal;U18408;Gauchan, Anamica;202300132;03;;24.11.2023;UNESCO - UN Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organisation;UNESCO - UN Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organisation;United Nations;I;Project- and programme grant;Earmarked to multilaterals;Project-type interventions;11110;111;Education, level unspecified;10;Education policy and administrative management;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Main;Main;-;-;-;The objective of this project is to support Nepal to develop climate smart education policies and create model schools and support Government of Nepal to integrate climate agenda in its education sector plan 2022-2031.

