;QZA-19/0216;The Private Financing Advisory Network (PFAN) 2019-2022;QTA-0002;UNIDO;D;2025;10.09.2025;Actual;- 891 863;0;NOK;2019;2024;UNIDO, Vienna;Grant;300513;KNN-ENERGI Seksjon for energi;0162;0162.72;0162.72.199;Tilbakebetaling - ubrukte;Global Unspecified;NORAD-U6155;Lunden, Henrik;;03;;03.12.2019;UNIDO - UN Industrial Development Organisation;UNIDO - UN Industrial Development Organisation;United Nations;I;Project- and programme grant;Earmarked to multilaterals;Contributions to specific-purpose programmes and funds managed by implementing partners;23110;231;Energy Policy;10;Energy policy and administrative management;;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;-;-;-;-;-;Main;-;-;-;-;The Private Financing Advisory Network (PFAN) identifies clean energy projects at an early stage and provides mentoring for development of a business plan, investment pitch, and growth strategy, significantly enhancing the possibility of financial closure.;In terms of geographical focus

