S;QZA-21/0162-6;NORHED II GROWNUT 2;QZA-0945;NORHED II;B;2025;12.03.2025;Actual;465 647;0;NOK;2021;2026;Universitetet i Bergen;Grant;300523;VEM-UTFORSK Seksjon for utdanning og forskning;0161;0161.70;0161.70.139;NORHED II;Congo, Dem. Rep.;NORAD-U18076;Rand, Tor-Øyvind;;03;;07.05.2021;UiB - Universitetet i Bergen;UNIKIN - Université de Kinshasa;Norwegian public sector;I(S);Project- and programme grant - with subunits;Triangular co-operation;Other technical assistance;11420;114;Post-secondary education;20;Higher education;;-;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;-;-;Main;-;-;-;-;-;-;The GROWNUT-2 project aims to develop a cadre of African nutrition scholars and academic leaders to address nutrition disorders and influence nutrition policy. In addition to supporting postgraduate programmes in nutritional epidemiology and locally relevant nutrition research, the project will provide appropriate multi-stakeholder feedback at local, national and international level to inform future partnerships and provide inputs to the wider policy and research on nutrition.;;
