S;QZA-23/0109-1;Oceans - Strengthening journalism’s capacity to support environmental sustainability;QZA-0792;Tax for Development Phase 2;B;2025;20.03.2025;Actual;7 780 176;0;NOK;2024;2028;Pulitzer Center on Crisis Reporting;Grant;300526;VEM-STYRE Seksjon for styresett;0163;0163.71;0163.71.123;Hav for utvikling;Global Unspecified;NORAD-U5063;Sørum, Vibeke;23/01254;03;;09.11.2023;Pulitzer Center on Crisis Reporting;Pulitzer Center on Crisis Reporting;NGO Other donor countries;I(S);Project- and programme grant - with subunits;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;41020;410;General environmental protection;20;Biosphere protection;;-;-;-;-;-;Main;-;Significant;Significant;-;-;Main;-;-;-;-;A key objective of grant scheme / chapter post163.71 is to promote more sustainable management of ocean resources and better protection of marine ecosystems. The project will contribute to better understanding of the connection between the ocean's economic importance and its environmental condition

