;RAF-22/0006;Blue Ventures - sustainable and inclusive coastal marine economy;QZA-0896;Hfu - Oceans for Development;B;2025;02.05.2025;Actual;2 870 357;0;NOK;2022;2025;Blue Ventures Conservation;Grant;300514;KNN-HAV Seksjon for hav;0162;0162.71;0162.71.112;Fisk for utvikling;Eastern Africa, regional;NORAD-U16936;Fremstad, Johanne Nordby;2100582;03;;07.07.2022;Blue Ventures;Blue Ventures;NGO Local;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;41010;410;General environmental protection;10;Environmental policy and administrative management;;-;-;-;-;-;Main;Significant;-;Main;-;-;-;Main;-;-;-;Agreement with the NGO Blue Ventures with the expected effects on society being that marine ecosystems are healthier and more resilient to climate change, and marine-based livelihoods are benfiting from sustainable  local management, with the technical support of three robust and dynamic not-for-profit civil society organizations in Tanzania and Kenya. The project will among other things focus on the participation of women in decision-making bodies  and measure the participation of the different genders in their activities.;;
;RAF-22/0007;WWF - Mangrove Management for Climate Risk Resilience and Improved Livelihoods;QZA-0896;Hfu - Oceans for Development;B;2025;01.07.2025;Actual;9 060 000;0;NOK;2022;2025;WWF Norge - Verdens Naturfond;Grant;300514;KNN-HAV Seksjon for hav;0163;0163.71;0163.71.123;Hav for utvikling;Eastern Africa, regional;NORAD-U16499;Johansen, Kari Synnøve;2100572;03;;31.05.2022;WWF - World Wildlife Fund;WWF Norge;NGO International;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;41010;410;General environmental protection;10;Environmental policy and administrative management;;-;-;-;-;-;Main;Significant;-;Significant;-;-;Significant;Main;-;-;-;The project will strengthen community management of important mangrove areas and strengthen climate change adaptation in coastal communities and ecosystems of Mozambique and Tanzania. Poor coastal communities will see their rights to manage and benefit from mangroves secured, their vulnerability to climate-related risks will be reduced, and sustainable, climate-resilient livelihood opportunities and enterprises will be developed for mangrove dependent coastal communities. Specific focus will be provided to gender equity and marginalized groups to ensure inclusive development.;;
