;TAN-15/0013;Tanzania Public Finance Management Reform Programme (PFMRP);TAN-2297;Strengthening Public Financial Mngt Prg;C;2025;31.07.2025;Actual;- 696 716;0;NOK;2015;2022;Public Financial Management Reform Program Basket Fund;Grant;4230;Dar es Salaam/Tanzania;0159;0159.75;0159.75.111;Afrika - nasjonale tiltak;Tanzania;U14600;Clemence, Priva;201800086;03;;02.12.2015;Tanzania Ministry of Finance;Zanzibar Ministry of Finance;Governments/Ministries in developing countries;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Basket funds/pooled funding (excluding funds managed by international organisations);15111;151;Government and civil society, general;11;Public finance management;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Main;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Support to PFMRP Phase IV and V through the national basket fund modality, mainly to the Zanzibar component. The goal is to promote economic development and improved public service delivery. Domestic revenue mobilisation (DRM) to finance development (SDG 17.1) is partly integrated in PFMRP. Zanzibar Revenue Board (ZRB) is a significant beneficiary of the Norwegian support.;Old case number phase 5: 201600463 + Old case number phase 4: 201500491

