;UKR-25/0028;KS Institutional Cooperation between Norwegian and Ukrainian Municipalities;UKR-0016;Ukraine Democracy Human Rights Transparency;B;2025;30.10.2025;Actual;5 000 000;0;NOK;2025;2026;KS-KOMMUNESEKTORENS ORGANISASJON;Grant;300540;UKR-NANSEN Avdeling for Nansen-programmet for Ukraina;0159;0159.73;0159.73.111;Ukraina og naboland;Ukraine;NORAD-U14828;Bugge, Tuva Grimsæth;2401482;03;;10.10.2025;KS - Kommunesektorens organisasjon;KS - Kommunesektorens organisasjon;NGO Norwegian;I;Project- and programme grant;Bilateral;Project-type interventions;15112;151;Government and civil society, general;12;Decentralisation and support to subnational government;;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;Significant;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;-;The pre-project aims to strengthen good governance at the local level in Ukraine. Institutional cooperation between municipalities in Norway and Ukraine is expected to contribute to improving Ukrainian municipalities' capacity for planning, service delivery and responsiveness to citizens' needs.  ;Preproject 1 Sept 2025 - 1 Mar 2026 for the inception phase of a multi-year programme on institutional cooperation between Norwegian and Ukranian municipalities.;
